e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZK6wARejqJwQ7kNvwHkcbmQ&_nc_oc=AdrVUvwFLtNyuQCV2aFNdHfXvxxfGyFvqfuCVIIkinzI3_KCQv3zeaFfB_x9n7EGoXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5ffz__MWCcKXi4K-DDx99df07tZyPVpfoVL96b0QpNfg&oe=6A05E579"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jRpOTLyYvrQQ7kNvwFn7eJG&_nc_oc=Adp9TrGTHMStATVZSi-neCVN2PHT6GvZPcPGQpxJe4gaMkzmksnfLjjoyHSbZA_zhSI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6-G54_8MkbKCcMk8UOc3aq9FWlcByqzyScuX8wiymiXA&oe=6A05BCD3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bHmkHixgmFUQ7kNvwHPuxsY&_nc_oc=AdoYB0hg97mRSNNdTevIT2eLKam9HLdV2A9XRl1U0NOA7u4YJpGbLGLdt4tbF1OzYAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af64kpyHqysQXbyR-BM2jfMNu2xEZ-cSRcBln-9S29OZ7g&oe=6A05C87B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DLcLNvhJCS8Q7kNvwHvS4Fd&_nc_oc=AdpYF-ZBYleMzZ135jjR4D01S9eEVefhgWWBfSpRWfGh4UrZ8I4T94E71YEBpzPCzhw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5HI4-P5lJDtfT6fGq4_-4qmabjwI51uvcBuBj18YDumQ&oe=6A05C9CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0joaG-f-Q_gQ7kNvwHmf1ky&_nc_oc=Adou69_TMZhPvYYONi30T0yaaoQResuM4H0kvkkCllP0X2w_EzcpJgdmmRupEh0OI5E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4yGLdGMhLrrnsXypeKJlgdxlTM5uTZYrIcq3BxRVfTHg&oe=6A05EB3E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se